WEBVTT

00:05.000 --> 00:06.880
<b>Hurry up!</b>

00:06.880 --> 00:08.020
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

00:09.400 --> 00:12.480
<b>If we don't hurry,
someone else will beat us to it!</b>

00:12.480 --> 00:13.870
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

00:14.270 --> 00:17.070
<b>The reward is huge this time.</b>

00:17.070 --> 00:18.560
<b>Get your act together...</b>

00:20.430 --> 00:21.290
<b>What?</b>

00:26.020 --> 00:27.090
<b>Over there!</b>

00:27.090 --> 00:28.590
<b>Kill him!</b>

00:32.470 --> 00:34.930
<b>Looks like this is going
to cause quite a stir.</b>

00:36.550 --> 00:37.950
<b>I can't believe it.</b>

00:38.950 --> 00:41.670
<b>They're taking such drastic measures.</b>

00:42.890 --> 00:44.190
<b>Brother...</b>

00:44.190 --> 00:47.440
<b>Wouldn't it be better to leave
through the underground passage?</b>

00:47.440 --> 00:51.320
<b>No, it's faster to escape
through the streets during the chaos.</b>

00:51.850 --> 00:54.120
<b>You've gathered all our forces, right?</b>

00:54.910 --> 00:56.760
<b>I've already made arrangements.</b>

00:56.760 --> 01:00.690
<b>Shiji Bau also reported
that she's hired the Iron Whale.</b>

01:00.690 --> 01:02.410
<b>The Iron Whale, huh?</b>

01:03.710 --> 01:06.420
<b>I wonder if they'll make it in time.</b>

01:06.420 --> 01:09.800
<b>Let the adventurers who are still able
to move deal with the intruders.</b>

01:10.800 --> 01:12.590
<b>Xylo Forbartz.</b>

01:13.160 --> 01:16.760
<b>If it's come to this, we have no choice
but to kill the one bound to the Goddess.</b>

01:17.350 --> 01:20.120
<b>Iri, stay by my side.</b>

01:20.730 --> 01:22.210
<b>Yes, Brother.</b>

01:22.690 --> 01:24.980
<b>I'll protect you
even if it costs me my life.</b>

01:24.980 --> 01:26.230
<b>Yes...</b>

01:26.790 --> 01:29.610
<b>Sacrificing your lives for each other.</b>

01:30.490 --> 01:33.330
<b>That's what a family should be.</b>

01:45.880 --> 01:48.970
<b>Sentenced to Be a Hero</b>

01:45.880 --> 01:48.970
<b>Sentenced to Be a Hero</b>

03:07.110 --> 03:08.330
<b>Curse you, Xylo.</b>

03:08.330 --> 03:11.300
<b>Has everything so far really
been going according to his plan?</b>

03:11.300 --> 03:14.260
<b>We can only hope so.</b>

03:14.690 --> 03:16.170
<b>If that's the case,</b>

03:16.170 --> 03:18.650
<b>I didn't expect him to be so violent.</b>

03:19.180 --> 03:20.680
<b>Let's go!</b>

03:20.680 --> 03:22.390
<b>Let's finish them off!</b>

03:30.310 --> 03:31.930
<b>Good grief...</b>

03:31.930 --> 03:33.690
<b>Now then, who's next?</b>

03:34.820 --> 03:36.650
<b>Well, that's not too bad.</b>

03:37.200 --> 03:38.530
<b>Hey, hey, hey!</b>

03:38.530 --> 03:41.160
<b>Give me a break!
I can't do business like this!</b>

03:41.160 --> 03:41.740
<b>Yikes!</b>

03:46.750 --> 03:48.120
<b>Those two...</b>

03:51.170 --> 03:52.210
<b>Tch!</b>

03:52.670 --> 03:53.670
<b>Take this!</b>

03:56.550 --> 03:58.150
<b>What's going on?</b>

04:05.910 --> 04:07.810
<b>- No way...
- My shop...</b>

04:08.940 --> 04:11.000
<b>Hey, control your firepower!</b>

04:11.000 --> 04:13.020
<b>It's to cut off the reinforcements.</b>

04:17.610 --> 04:18.950
<b>Children?</b>

04:20.930 --> 04:22.030
<b>What should we do?</b>

04:22.990 --> 04:24.040
<b>How many are there?</b>

04:24.630 --> 04:25.290
<b>Damn it...</b>

04:26.910 --> 04:29.930
<b>As long as you watch out
for the children attacking from below,</b>

04:29.930 --> 04:31.250
<b>they're no real threat.</b>

04:31.250 --> 04:33.000
<b>I know, but...</b>

04:34.210 --> 04:35.380
<b>Too slow!</b>

04:42.470 --> 04:44.260
<b>The seal of violet lightning, Gwemel?</b>

04:44.260 --> 04:48.390
<b>Do you understand how to fight now,
Lady Holy Knight?</b>

04:48.390 --> 04:50.770
<b>Xylo, what's our next move?</b>

04:50.770 --> 04:55.900
<b>I hope there's something
more than fruit in that head of yours.</b>

04:56.400 --> 04:58.590
<b>I'm going to make a bigger ruckus.</b>

04:58.590 --> 05:01.990
<b>If that happens, Lideo Sodrick
won't be able to stand by and watch.</b>

05:03.780 --> 05:06.600
<b>You're no smarter than a piece of fruit.</b>

05:06.600 --> 05:08.330
<b>There's no plan more sloppy than this—</b>

05:08.330 --> 05:09.790
<b>That's enough!</b>

05:14.130 --> 05:18.410
<b>So you're the ones
who disturbed the peace of the town?</b>

05:19.950 --> 05:22.020
<b>You'd better prepare yourselves!</b>

05:23.050 --> 05:24.810
<b>Who are those people?</b>

05:24.810 --> 05:27.850
<b>Are they the ones maintaining
the peace of the town?</b>

05:27.850 --> 05:29.060
<b>It seems so.</b>

05:30.100 --> 05:32.520
<b>It looks like you don't know who we are.</b>

05:32.900 --> 05:36.000
<b>We're top-ranked members
of the Ioff Adventurers Guild,</b>

05:36.000 --> 05:40.080
<b>the Giant-Hunter Brigade,
bringing bloodshed wherever we go.</b>

05:40.080 --> 05:41.490
<b>Never heard of you.</b>

05:42.980 --> 05:45.780
<b>You bastards! I won't forgive you!</b>

05:45.780 --> 05:46.910
<b>Lightning staff!</b>

05:47.440 --> 05:49.330
<b>Fire!</b>

05:52.160 --> 05:53.960
<b>Idiots! Where are you shooting?</b>

05:54.360 --> 05:55.590
<b>What's going on?</b>

05:56.090 --> 05:58.170
<b>What a farce.</b>

05:59.420 --> 06:00.720
<b>Fire...!</b>

06:00.720 --> 06:03.380
<b>If you hit them,
I'll reward you handsomely!</b>

06:03.980 --> 06:05.860
<b>It's not powerful,
and it lacks accuracy.</b>

06:05.860 --> 06:08.170
<b>It's just something
to liven up a festival.</b>

06:09.110 --> 06:10.100
<b>Sigh...</b>

06:11.310 --> 06:13.190
<b>- I'll leave this to you.
- Wait!</b>

06:13.190 --> 06:15.270
<b>Don't dump these weirdos on us!</b>

06:18.230 --> 06:18.980
<b>Tch.</b>

06:20.970 --> 06:22.570
<b>Eat this!</b>

06:47.760 --> 06:52.840
<b>Attacking Xylo or me means
declaring war on the Mastibolt family.</b>

06:52.840 --> 06:54.310
<b>You will regret this.</b>

06:54.650 --> 06:56.540
<b>If you really care about this town,</b>

06:56.540 --> 06:59.240
<b>stop this nonsense
and do your job properly.</b>

07:00.650 --> 07:02.540
<b>You two get along surprisingly well.</b>

07:10.580 --> 07:11.830
<b>A troll!</b>

07:11.830 --> 07:14.580
<b>Does Sodrick keep faeries as pets?</b>

07:15.210 --> 07:19.500
<b>Well, at least
it's not some badly trained pet.</b>

07:37.230 --> 07:39.310
<b>We have the upper hand.</b>

07:39.310 --> 07:41.190
<b>That's it! Drive them into a corner!</b>

07:41.190 --> 07:41.980
<b>Oh!</b>

07:41.980 --> 07:43.190
<b>Go!</b>

07:44.420 --> 07:45.860
<b>If you want to fight...</b>

07:48.120 --> 07:49.160
<b>Ah... damn it!</b>

07:51.990 --> 07:55.000
<b>It seems you still need my protection.</b>

07:56.020 --> 08:00.540
<b>My knight, the sorry state you are in
is your punishment for abandoning me.</b>

08:00.540 --> 08:01.880
<b>However,</b>

08:01.880 --> 08:05.510
<b>I, the great goddess,
shall graciously save you!</b>

08:05.510 --> 08:08.280
<b>All right, everyone! It is time!</b>

08:08.280 --> 08:11.850
<b>- All right. Move out!
- I owe Siena and Zofflec an apology...</b>

08:12.430 --> 08:14.100
<b>Who are they?</b>

08:14.600 --> 08:16.470
<b>I advise you to listen to me.</b>

08:16.470 --> 08:19.770
<b>You'd better leave now or surrender.</b>

08:20.400 --> 08:21.980
<b>Otherwise, people will die.</b>

08:28.200 --> 08:29.750
<b>Brother, this way.</b>

08:30.830 --> 08:33.210
<b>I won't let him provoke me.</b>

08:33.210 --> 08:36.190
<b>Right now, the most important thing
is not to let him know where I am.</b>

08:37.620 --> 08:39.750
<b>I am Norgalle Senridge</b>

08:39.750 --> 08:43.590
<b>of the United Kingdom
of Zef-Zeyal Meht Kioh.</b>

08:43.590 --> 08:44.590
<b>My loyal subjects—</b>

08:44.590 --> 08:46.120
<b>- Shut up!
- Who the heck are you?</b>

08:46.120 --> 08:47.130
<b>I'll kill you, you know!</b>

08:47.130 --> 08:48.670
<b>- Come down!
- Get lost!</b>

08:48.670 --> 08:50.010
<b>Die!</b>

08:50.590 --> 08:51.680
<b>Hmm.</b>

08:51.680 --> 08:53.140
<b>Unfortunately,</b>

08:53.140 --> 08:56.890
<b>I never thought
I'd have to resort to vigilantism.</b>

08:58.060 --> 09:03.710
<b>For the crime of treason, you're hereby
sentenced to be executed by explosion.</b>

09:09.700 --> 09:11.240
<b>Damn it! Attack!</b>

09:12.260 --> 09:13.200
<b>Mm.</b>

09:26.920 --> 09:27.800
<b>Hyah!</b>

09:28.590 --> 09:30.320
<b>Charge!</b>

09:31.930 --> 09:33.760
<b>Cavalry, huh...</b>

09:33.760 --> 09:35.590
<b>What a pain in the ass.</b>

09:37.010 --> 09:38.350
<b>Take this.</b>

09:41.890 --> 09:42.700
<b>What's going on?</b>

09:42.700 --> 09:43.670
<b>Damn it!</b>

09:43.670 --> 09:44.900
<b>Go around!</b>

09:47.020 --> 09:48.780
<b>Brace yourselves!</b>

09:48.780 --> 09:49.360
<b>Take that!</b>

10:03.830 --> 10:06.890
<b>I feel sorry for the horses
that got dragged into this.</b>

10:06.890 --> 10:08.200
<b>Alright, hurry and escape.</b>

10:14.220 --> 10:15.470
<b>For real?</b>

10:23.730 --> 10:24.960
<b>Xylo, go!</b>

10:24.960 --> 10:27.110
<b>We'll hold it back.</b>

10:28.820 --> 10:29.860
<b>Teoritta!</b>

10:30.990 --> 10:32.470
<b>My knight!</b>

10:32.950 --> 10:35.640
<b>Lend me your strength
and defeat them!</b>

10:36.490 --> 10:40.170
<b>Have you realized just how important
a dependable goddess like me is?</b>

10:40.170 --> 10:42.450
<b>Yes, that's absolutely right!</b>

10:44.420 --> 10:46.130
<b>Commander, this way!</b>

10:46.130 --> 10:47.380
<b>Rajit!</b>

10:47.380 --> 10:50.340
<b>Can you do it, Xylo Forbartz?</b>

10:51.380 --> 10:52.650
<b>Let's go!</b>

10:52.650 --> 10:54.090
<b>Very well!</b>

10:55.090 --> 10:56.390
<b>My knight!</b>

10:56.390 --> 10:58.470
<b>Finish it quickly!</b>

11:06.520 --> 11:08.480
<b>Take this!</b>

11:20.280 --> 11:21.290
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

11:21.950 --> 11:23.000
<b>You saved me.</b>

11:24.140 --> 11:25.900
<b>Is that all?</b>

11:25.900 --> 11:28.660
<b>Are you not forgetting
the most important part, the praise?</b>

11:32.000 --> 11:36.630
<b>I want to receive praise
from my knight personally.</b>

11:36.630 --> 11:41.150
<b>Xylo, I want to hear you say,
"You are truly amazing."</b>

11:46.390 --> 11:49.020
<b>You're truly an amazing goddess.</b>

11:59.680 --> 12:02.270
<b>What in the world is going on...?</b>

12:02.270 --> 12:04.160
<b>You should understand by now.</b>

12:04.160 --> 12:07.110
<b>If you truly wish to atone,</b>

12:07.110 --> 12:09.110
<b>then I shall forgive you.</b>

12:11.850 --> 12:14.840
<b>Who are these guys...?</b>

12:17.130 --> 12:18.800
<b>Don't push!</b>

12:21.220 --> 12:22.730
<b>How could this be...?</b>

12:24.410 --> 12:27.340
<b>The town passed down
from our ancestors...</b>

12:29.520 --> 12:31.690
<b>Brother, don't leave me!</b>

12:31.690 --> 12:32.690
<b>Wait...</b>

12:32.690 --> 12:34.050
<b>Brother!</b>

12:34.050 --> 12:34.860
<b>Iri!</b>

12:34.860 --> 12:36.650
<b>Um, I'm sorry...</b>

12:39.110 --> 12:42.570
<b>I really didn't want to do this...</b>

12:42.980 --> 12:45.490
<b>But a really nasty guy threatened me...</b>

12:45.490 --> 12:47.760
<b>This is the last thing I want to do...</b>

12:48.540 --> 12:51.560
<b>- Li—
- I'm truly sorry about this...</b>

12:52.070 --> 12:55.080
<b>but please, just come with me.</b>

12:55.080 --> 12:57.160
<b>I won't do anything to you...</b>

13:14.080 --> 13:16.320
<b>This is quite a mess.</b>

13:16.860 --> 13:19.730
<b>It seems things have gotten
quite troublesome.</b>

13:20.170 --> 13:22.960
<b>Lideo Sodrick
might already be dead, you know.</b>

13:22.960 --> 13:24.910
<b>Gosh, this is too much.</b>

13:26.160 --> 13:30.360
<b>I finally made it out,
and the client's going to die like this?</b>

13:32.500 --> 13:35.190
<b>No reward, no deal.</b>

13:35.190 --> 13:36.620
<b>I'm out.</b>

13:38.740 --> 13:43.160
<b>I'll collect the money
from the Adventurers Guild and leave.</b>

13:43.160 --> 13:45.120
<b>Boojum, what are you going to do?</b>

13:45.670 --> 13:49.290
<b>I'm going to save Lideo Sodrick.</b>

13:49.290 --> 13:51.570
<b>It's the right thing to do.</b>

13:51.570 --> 13:52.810
<b>Are you serious?</b>

13:52.810 --> 13:55.610
<b>He took care of me, after all.</b>

13:55.610 --> 13:58.120
<b>I don't expect you to help...</b>

13:58.550 --> 13:59.500
<b>Hmm?</b>

13:59.500 --> 14:01.610
<b>No, wait a second.</b>

14:04.120 --> 14:06.830
<b>I see, so this is it?</b>

14:07.450 --> 14:09.080
<b>What a shame.</b>

14:09.410 --> 14:10.600
<b>What's wrong?</b>

14:10.600 --> 14:12.180
<b>I received an order.</b>

14:12.180 --> 14:15.710
<b>We'll have to cut ties
with Lideo Sodrick.</b>

14:16.310 --> 14:18.940
<b>Your goal is money, right?</b>

14:18.940 --> 14:21.630
<b>Then, how about a new job?</b>

14:22.570 --> 14:23.550
<b>What?</b>

14:24.300 --> 14:25.640
<b>Who's the client?</b>

14:26.350 --> 14:27.760
<b>We are.</b>

14:34.770 --> 14:36.020
<b>These guys...</b>

14:37.370 --> 14:38.730
<b>Stop it.</b>

14:39.480 --> 14:40.940
<b>That's rude.</b>

14:49.080 --> 14:51.160
<b>Boojum, who exactly are you...</b>

14:51.160 --> 14:52.840
<b>We'll pay you.</b>

14:53.290 --> 14:58.010
<b>That's what makes humans work hard, right?</b>

14:58.750 --> 15:00.880
<b>I don't mind.</b>

15:00.880 --> 15:04.720
<b>As long as I get paid,
adventurers or Demon Blight,</b>

15:04.720 --> 15:06.470
<b>they're all good clients to me.</b>

15:06.470 --> 15:09.030
<b>So, what's the request,</b>

15:09.030 --> 15:09.930
<b>client?</b>

15:09.930 --> 15:13.010
<b>I'm not the client.</b>

15:13.960 --> 15:19.010
<b>But the order was to erase
any evidence linking us to Lideo Sodrick,</b>

15:19.480 --> 15:19.480
<b>literally without leaving a single trace.</b>

15:23.400 --> 15:26.460
<b>No problem. This is my forte.</b>

15:26.460 --> 15:28.890
<b>Thank you for your cooperation.</b>

15:28.890 --> 15:31.660
<b>Shiji Bau, what about you?</b>

15:32.620 --> 15:35.240
<b>You're the mentor
in charge of teaching me.</b>

15:35.240 --> 15:36.730
<b>I suppose I owe you one.</b>

15:36.730 --> 15:38.630
<b>I don't really want to kill you.</b>

15:40.450 --> 15:44.900
<b>You want me to betray humanity, right?</b>

15:44.900 --> 15:47.710
<b>Is something troubling you?</b>

15:48.430 --> 15:53.150
<b>Lideo Sodrick taught me
something very important.</b>

15:53.150 --> 15:58.870
<b>The most important thing for humans is
to protect themselves and their families.</b>

15:58.870 --> 16:05.150
<b>What matters most
is protecting their interests, isn't it?</b>

16:05.150 --> 16:09.360
<b>It's worth protecting
more than the entire race.</b>

16:09.360 --> 16:13.000
<b>That's what humans are, isn't it?</b>

16:16.130 --> 16:16.980
<b>Yeah.</b>

16:17.750 --> 16:19.260
<b>You're right.</b>

16:22.800 --> 16:24.300
<b>Keep an eye on the surroundings!</b>

16:24.680 --> 16:26.490
<b>You shall serve me as atonement.</b>

16:26.490 --> 16:28.510
<b>Give your lives in service to the people!</b>

16:28.510 --> 16:31.590
<b>Yes! Guys, let's go!</b>

16:31.590 --> 16:32.680
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

16:35.850 --> 16:36.850
<b>Xylo.</b>

16:37.310 --> 16:39.790
<b>We'll go and check the second floor.</b>

16:39.790 --> 16:42.990
<b>We might find some physical evidence.</b>

16:44.150 --> 16:46.650
<b>Now, reflect on what you have done.</b>

16:46.650 --> 16:49.610
<b>Repent for your crimes at once!</b>

16:51.320 --> 16:52.620
<b>What do you think?</b>

16:52.620 --> 16:55.910
<b>He seems to be in awe
of my divine majesty.</b>

16:55.910 --> 16:57.010
<b>Can't really tell.</b>

16:57.010 --> 16:58.410
<b>I am sure of it.</b>

16:58.410 --> 17:01.060
<b>Now, tell us everything you know.</b>

17:01.060 --> 17:04.630
<b>Yes. As the guild master
of the Adventurers Guild,</b>

17:04.630 --> 17:06.890
<b>I intended to kill you,</b>

17:06.890 --> 17:09.510
<b>but I know nothing about the client.</b>

17:09.510 --> 17:12.140
<b>Uh... that's a problem.</b>

17:12.140 --> 17:13.850
<b>Don't take everything so seriously.</b>

17:17.010 --> 17:18.450
<b>Let me tell you this.</b>

17:18.450 --> 17:21.180
<b>You're in a very difficult position
right now.</b>

17:21.180 --> 17:24.690
<b>Normally, I would just hand you
over to the Holy Knights,</b>

17:25.210 --> 17:27.900
<b>but I don't have to do that.</b>

17:27.900 --> 17:30.440
<b>Hey, don't negotiate with him
on your own!</b>

17:30.440 --> 17:33.280
<b>Then, shall we make him confess
the easy way?</b>

17:33.280 --> 17:35.980
<b>I think he's used to
being treated violently.</b>

17:37.990 --> 17:40.150
<b>If you want to make a deal...</b>

17:40.150 --> 17:41.750
<b>will you accept my condition?</b>

17:43.250 --> 17:44.460
<b>Let's hear it.</b>

17:46.020 --> 17:50.920
<b>Protect my sisters and brothers.
Keep my family safe.</b>

17:50.920 --> 17:53.610
<b>Those creepy kids?</b>

17:54.260 --> 17:56.890
<b>If you promise to leave them alone,</b>

17:57.470 --> 17:59.350
<b>I'll consider cooperating.</b>

18:01.940 --> 18:03.020
<b>Sigh...</b>

18:03.810 --> 18:04.810
<b>Got it.</b>

18:04.810 --> 18:07.940
<b>Xylo, you have no right to do so!</b>

18:07.940 --> 18:10.230
<b>Then are you going to
find them and kill them?</b>

18:10.230 --> 18:13.950
<b>Or are you going to bring them before him
and torture them one by one?</b>

18:14.440 --> 18:16.280
<b>I didn't say that.</b>

18:16.280 --> 18:17.910
<b>Then shut up.</b>

18:18.440 --> 18:21.660
<b>Lideo Sodrick, just tell me what you can.</b>

18:21.660 --> 18:23.250
<b>That's a good deal,
don't you think?</b>

18:25.630 --> 18:28.280
<b>The goal is to eliminate the goddess...</b>

18:30.010 --> 18:33.340
<b>The client calls themselves
the coexisters.</b>

18:33.880 --> 18:36.220
<b>It's their names again...</b>

18:36.850 --> 18:38.720
<b>It happened ten days ago.</b>

18:39.390 --> 18:42.930
<b>At first, a man in a black mask
approached me.</b>

18:43.400 --> 18:48.650
<b>He said he wanted to make a deal,
but in reality, I had no choice.</b>

18:49.230 --> 18:52.990
<b>Obey and embrace coexistence, or die.</b>

18:54.820 --> 18:59.240
<b>After that, I made contact
with the brokers three times.</b>

18:59.830 --> 19:02.010
<b>They're everywhere.</b>

19:02.890 --> 19:06.380
<b>If I don't want to die,
I have to show them results.</b>

19:07.750 --> 19:11.260
<b>So you're betraying humanity
because you're afraid of dying?</b>

19:11.260 --> 19:13.760
<b>You have the power
to fight back, don't you?</b>

19:14.210 --> 19:17.790
<b>It seems that the coexisters plan
to put the Demon Lord in power</b>

19:17.790 --> 19:20.920
<b>and serve as overseers under him.</b>

19:20.920 --> 19:23.430
<b>Simply put, there will be slaves,</b>

19:23.430 --> 19:25.730
<b>the overseers of those slaves,
and a ruler.</b>

19:26.120 --> 19:28.530
<b>The corruption has already
spread across many regions,</b>

19:28.530 --> 19:31.650
<b>robbing countless people
of their lives and their land.</b>

19:32.280 --> 19:34.310
<b>At this rate, humanity will fall.</b>

19:34.780 --> 19:39.030
<b>Then I must at least secure
a position as an overseer.</b>

19:39.530 --> 19:42.080
<b>It's necessary for my family.</b>

19:43.470 --> 19:45.500
<b>I don't want to know your reasons.</b>

19:45.870 --> 19:47.760
<b>Give me some useful intel.</b>

19:47.760 --> 19:49.960
<b>Otherwise,
none of your conditions will be met.</b>

19:51.960 --> 19:54.070
<b>That man in the black mask...</b>

19:54.620 --> 19:57.050
<b>I did hear his name.</b>

19:57.590 --> 20:00.430
<b>Tell me, even though
I'm sure it's a fake name.</b>

20:02.470 --> 20:04.710
<b>Mahaeyzel Zelkoff.</b>

20:04.710 --> 20:06.390
<b>Don't be ridiculous.</b>

20:06.390 --> 20:08.770
<b>Mahaeyzel is the name of a saint.</b>

20:08.770 --> 20:12.190
<b>He was the leader of the Temple
during the First War of Subjugation.</b>

20:12.730 --> 20:14.680
<b>And that Zelkoff...</b>

20:15.320 --> 20:17.160
<b>That name is...</b>

20:20.490 --> 20:21.280
<b>Wait! Say it aga—</b>

20:24.120 --> 20:25.700
<b>Y-Your Majesty! Your Majesty!</b>

20:26.330 --> 20:28.190
<b>- What?
- Is it an attack?</b>

20:32.200 --> 20:34.750
<b>It's all for money.</b>

20:35.090 --> 20:37.010
<b>Now die quietly.</b>

20:41.260 --> 20:42.510
<b>Th-The building is being...</b>

20:42.510 --> 20:43.810
<b>Escape outside now!</b>

20:43.810 --> 20:44.970
<b>Tsk!</b>

20:44.970 --> 20:46.270
<b>What's going on...</b>

20:47.350 --> 20:48.440
<b>Is it artillery?</b>

20:48.440 --> 20:49.730
<b>Whoa!</b>

20:53.000 --> 20:54.360
<b>Xylo, hurry up!</b>

20:54.690 --> 20:55.810
<b>Kivia, hurry—</b>

20:55.810 --> 20:58.260
<b>Wait! That man is...</b>

20:59.000 --> 21:00.030
<b>Stop!</b>

21:00.950 --> 21:02.050
<b>Damn it!</b>

21:03.070 --> 21:04.800
<b>Run! Do you want to die?</b>

21:11.820 --> 21:13.130
<b>It's coming again! Get down!</b>

21:18.340 --> 21:20.390
<b>What is this?</b>

21:20.390 --> 21:22.760
<b>Who would do something
like this in the street?</b>

21:22.760 --> 21:24.140
<b>Have they lost their minds?</b>

21:24.140 --> 21:26.770
<b>Damn it! If only Neely were here...</b>

21:26.770 --> 21:29.480
<b>Hey, don't blame Neely.</b>

21:29.480 --> 21:30.650
<b>I'll kill you, you know.</b>

21:30.650 --> 21:31.940
<b>That's not what I meant...</b>

21:32.310 --> 21:36.790
<b>Since the enemy has artillery,
we need Rhyno's strength.</b>

21:36.790 --> 21:40.320
<b>We have to find a way to get him
out of the punishment room.</b>

21:40.320 --> 21:41.450
<b>Huh...</b>

21:41.450 --> 21:43.660
<b>I don't like being with Rhyno.</b>

21:43.660 --> 21:46.370
<b>Kivia, let's go after Lideo Sodrick.</b>

21:48.110 --> 21:49.720
<b>Ah, yes...</b>

21:49.720 --> 21:51.230
<b>You're right...</b>

21:54.870 --> 21:58.490
<b>We also need to confirm
what that man said...</b>

21:59.380 --> 22:01.090
<b>whether it's true or false.</b>

22:07.960 --> 22:09.240
<b>Brother...?</b>

22:11.430 --> 22:12.260
<b>Iri...?</b>

22:12.760 --> 22:14.190
<b>Is that you, Iri?</b>

22:14.190 --> 22:15.860
<b>Brother!</b>

22:16.730 --> 22:17.610
<b>Iri!</b>

22:17.900 --> 22:19.400
<b>You're safe!</b>

22:19.890 --> 22:21.670
<b>Yes, I am.</b>

22:21.670 --> 22:22.900
<b>I managed to escape...</b>

22:23.410 --> 22:26.240
<b>I lost the guild,
but at least I'm still alive.</b>

22:27.240 --> 22:28.730
<b>What about the other kids?</b>

22:29.190 --> 22:33.290
<b>Apart from a few who were captured
by the Holy Knights, the others are ahead...</b>

22:33.970 --> 22:35.150
<b>Thank goodness.</b>

22:36.130 --> 22:38.810
<b>It came at a cost,</b>

22:38.810 --> 22:41.130
<b>but you're all safe now.</b>

22:41.130 --> 22:42.260
<b>A cost...?</b>

22:44.840 --> 22:45.800
<b>Brother.</b>

22:46.220 --> 22:48.010
<b>Did you tell them something?</b>

22:48.010 --> 22:50.600
<b>No, I didn't say anything important.</b>

22:51.350 --> 22:52.640
<b>I see...</b>

22:53.730 --> 22:55.110
<b>Iri?</b>

23:02.150 --> 23:03.490
<b>Sorry, Brother.</b>

23:04.030 --> 23:05.200
<b>This is just a precaution.</b>

23:11.540 --> 23:14.000
<b>You... You're...</b>

23:14.720 --> 23:16.500
<b>Where's Iri...?</b>

23:16.500 --> 23:17.790
<b>She's dead.</b>

23:18.350 --> 23:20.940
<b>I borrowed her body and brain.</b>

23:20.940 --> 23:23.090
<b>And the other kids are over there.</b>

23:27.360 --> 23:29.330
<b>How... How could this be...</b>

23:30.100 --> 23:31.260
<b>My...</b>

23:31.830 --> 23:35.520
<b>My most precious... family...</b>

23:37.430 --> 23:38.480
<b>Goodbye,</b>

23:38.940 --> 23:40.270
<b>my former brother.</b>

23:55.960 --> 23:59.250
<b>Looks like we need to speed up the plan.</b>

24:00.060 --> 24:02.400
<b>Get ready to destroy this city.</b>

24:02.400 --> 24:06.800
<b>Annihilate all humans
and turn everything tangible to ash.</b>

24:07.320 --> 24:13.430
<b>Especially the Goddess Teoritta.
Kill her by any means necessary.</b>

24:14.100 --> 24:16.940
<b>Can you give me some time?</b>

24:17.520 --> 24:20.650
<b>I want to give Lideo Sodrick
a proper burial.</b>

24:21.150 --> 24:23.230
<b>There's no need for that.</b>

24:23.230 --> 24:27.020
<b>You've been placed under my command.</b>

24:28.490 --> 24:32.070
<b>I'm sorry, Lideo Sodrick.</b>

24:32.070 --> 24:34.740
<b>Thank you for buying me the book.</b>

24:35.410 --> 24:37.160
<b>It's not just Boojum.</b>

24:37.160 --> 24:39.680
<b>I need all of your help too.</b>

24:39.680 --> 24:40.880
<b>Of course,</b>

24:40.880 --> 24:43.840
<b>you'll be compensated accordingly.</b>

24:45.030 --> 24:45.920
<b>Okay...</b>

24:46.550 --> 24:48.550
<b>But there's one thing I want to know.</b>

24:49.010 --> 24:51.550
<b>What should we call you?</b>

24:52.040 --> 24:53.680
<b>Spriggan.</b>

24:54.610 --> 24:56.270
<b>Please call me...</b>

24:57.390 --> 24:59.520
<b>Spriggan.</b>
